l)\n\n## \\$241.99\n\n4K 60Hz 4:4:4 HDR, up to 394 ft (120 m). Good for long-distance home theater and professional AV installations.\n\nSeller: Best Buy\n\n---\n\n\ue200image_group\ue202{\"query\":[\"AV Access 4KEX70-L HDBaseT HDMI extender transmitter receiver product\"],\"aspect_ratio\":\"1:1\",\"layout\":\"carousel\",\"num_per_query\":1}\ue201\n\n2\\. \ue200entity\ue202[\"product\",\"AV Access 4KEX70-L\"]\ue201\n\nBest budget option\n\n## \\$119.99\n\n4K 60Hz up to 130 ft (40 m), bi-directional PoE, IR and RS-232. Best for shorter runs where full 4:4:4 isn't required.\n\n\ue200url\ue202Manufacturer listing\ue202https://www.avaccess.com/hdmi-extenders/\ue201\n\n---\n\n\ue200image_group\ue202{\"entity_refs\":[\"turn283239product13\"],\"aspect_ratio\":\"1:1\",\"layout\":\"carousel\",\"num_per_query\":1}\ue201\n\n3\\. \ue200entity\ue202[\"turn283239product13\",\"4K HDBaseT HDMI\u2122 Extender (Loop) - 400ft (cat6) (UHD-EXB400R\u2026\"]\ue201\n\nBest long-range value\n\n## \\$164.95\n\n4K 60Hz 4:4:4, up to 400 ft (122 m), HDR, IR and local HDMI loop-out.\n\nOREI.COM \u00b7 5/5 (19 reviews)\n\n---\n\n\ue200image_group\ue202{\"entity_refs\":[\"turn283239product0\"],\"aspect_ratio\":\"1:1\",\"layout\":\"carousel\",\"num_per_query\":1}\ue201\n\n4\\. \ue200entity\ue202[\"turn283239product0\",\"AV Access HDBaseT 3.0 HDMI KVM Extender, Uncompressed 5K@60H\u2026\"]\ue201\n\nBest for gaming and KVM\n\n## \\$359.99\n\nHDBaseT 3.0, 4K 120Hz, up to 330 ft (100 m), USB KVM functionality.\n\nSeller: Walmart - ACTIONS GLOBAL US INC\n\nSpecifications and pricing are from current listings and manufacturer information. \ue200cite\ue202turn283239search0\ue202turn283239search5\ue202turn283239search1\ue201\n\n## Quick comparison\n\n| Model | 4K capability | Advertised range | Best for |\n|--------|--------|--------|--------|\n| J-Tech UHDT150 | 60Hz 4:4:4 | 394 ft | Overall |\n| AV Access 4KEX70-L | 60Hz 4:2:0 | 130 ft | Budget |\n| OREI EXB400R-K | 60Hz 4:4:4 | 400 ft | Long distance |\n| AV Access KVM Pro | 120Hz | 330 ft | Gaming / PC |\n\n**My recommendation\\:** Choose the OREI UHD-EXB400R-K for a cost-effective long-range 4K 60Hz installation, or the J-Tech UHDT150"}]}       

